# Trail timeline

Import WebBoard from "./web_board.lg".
Import WebFormat from "./web_format.lg".

A problem's trail, newest first, fetched when the section appears: what was tried, by which contributor, model and
strategy, what the kernel said and why an attempt failed, what it cost, what it
suggested next, and the hash links that make the history tamper-evident.

## Component TrailSection (pid: Text) and (check: Text)

State:
    Let rows be a new Seq of TrailRow.

Actions:
    When this component appears:
        Get "/api/v1/problem/timeline?id=" + urlEncode(pid) + "&limit=200" as Seq of TrailRow, then arrived.

    To arrived (answer: Result of Seq of TrailRow and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set rows to list.
            When Err (e):
                Set rows to a new Seq of TrailRow.

View:
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Trail <span class="chip" id="trail-check">chain {check}</span></h2>
      <ol class="timeline" id="timeline">
        {for each t in rows, keyed by t's seq:}
          <li class="v-{t's verdict} trail-entry">
            <div class="entry-head">
              <b>#{t's seq}</b><span class="chip kind">{t's kind}</span>
              <span class="verdict v-{t's verdict}">{verdictWords(t's verdict)}</span>
              <span class="entry-meta">{formatStamp(t's ts)} · {t's contributor} · {t's model} · strategy {t's strategyId} · {formatMoney(t's costMicros)}</span>
            </div>
            {if t's summary is not equal to "":}<p>{t's summary}</p>{end}
            {if t's diagnostics is not equal to "":}
              <details class="diag"><summary>What the kernel said</summary><pre class="doc">{t's diagnostics}</pre></details>
            {end}
            {if t's suggestions is not equal to "":}<p class="muted">Next: {t's suggestions}</p>{end}
            <div class="hash">{shortHash(t's prevHash)} → {shortHash(t's hash)} · {t's artifacts} artifacts</div>
          </li>
        {else:}
          <li class="empty">Nothing has been tried yet. The first attempt will read this empty trail and know it is the first.</li>
        {end}
      </ol>
    </div>
